        "@value": "MULCHMULCHMULCH is MULCH Collective’s first experience collaborating and exhibiting work together. The works presented are the result of a year-long endeavour to establish an artistic network of collaboration and cooperation, in an effort to support, degenerate, entangle, repurpose, and enrich each"
